name: ['AWOL', 'Abstract Iguanart', 'Acornelia, Fashionable Filcher', 'Adorable Kitten', 'Alexander Clamilton', 'Avatar of Me', 'B-I-N-G-O', 'B.O.B. (Bevy of Beebles)', 'Bat-', 'Blast from the Past', 'Boomstacker', 'Booster Tutor', 'Bronze Calendar', 'Carnivorous Death-Parrot', 'Cheatyface', 'Chicken à la King', 'Common Courtesy', 'Common Iguana', 'Dirty Rat', 'Duh', 'Elvish Impersonators', 'Emcee', 'Enter the Dungeon', 'Entirely Normal Armchair', 'Flavor Judge', 'Forest', 'Frankie Peanuts', 'Free-Range Chicken', 'GO TO JAIL', 'Goblin Haberdasher', 'Goblin S.W.A.T. Team', 'Goblin Tutor', 'Growth Spurt', 'Half-Squirrel, Half-', 'Hoisted Hireling', 'Humming-', 'Infernal Spawn of Evil', 'Infernal Spawn of Infernal Spawn of Evil', 'Infernius Spawnington III, Esq.', 'Infinity Elemental', 'Inhumaniac', 'Island', 'Jack-in-the-Mox', 'Johnny, Combo Player', 'Jumbo Imp', 'Knight of the Hokey Pokey', "Krark's Other Thumb", "Look at Me, I'm R&D", "Look at Me, I'm the DCI", 'Magic Word', 'Mer Man', 'Mother Kangaroo', 'Mountain', 'Old Fogey', 'Old Guard', 'Ordinary Pony', 'Painiac', 'Paper Tiger', 'Pippa, Duchess of Dice', 'Plains', 'Pointy Finger of Doom', 'Poultrygeist', 'Richard Garfield, Ph.D.', 'Rings a Bell', 'Rock Lobster', 'Scissors Lizard', 'Six-y Beast', 'Skull Saucer', 'Slaying Mantis', 'Snickering Squirrel', 'Spirit of the Season', 'Squirrel Farm', 'Staying Power', 'Stet, Draconic Proofreader', 'Stinging Scorpion', 'Strategy, Schmategy', 'Strutting Turkey', 'Super-Duper Death Ray', 'Surgeon General Commander', 'Swamp', 'Sword of Dungeons & Dragons', 'Syr Cadian, Knight Owl', 'Time Out', 'Timmy, Power Gamer', 'Topsy Turvy', 'Underdome', 'Wall of Fortune', 'Water Gun Balloon Game', 'Who // What // When // Where // Why', 'Wild Crocodile', 'Yet Another Aether Vortex']
